<title>FRANCE: Schneider chairman has prepared successor.</title>
<headline>Schneider chairman has prepared successor.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of French electrical engineering company Schneider SA said on Tuesday the succession of the group was &quot;assured.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;I do not think think any more about my succession,&quot; Didier Pineau-Valencienne told Reuters on the fringes of a shareholders meeting. &quot;Everything is organised. I will announce it at the last minute.&quot;</p>
<p>Pineau-Valencienne is 66 years old and has been Schneider chairman since 1981.</p>
</text>
